  "body": "Simplify your life, no more lawns or worries about maintenance, everything is taken care of here. If you are a downsizer, someone looking for a very nice bolthole or a new to the property ladder you will be impressed. Beautifully renovated, this light-filled first-floor Stanley Court apartment enjoys sweeping city and harbour views while being thoughtfully positioned well back from the cliff edge for added peace of mind. Bathed in all-day sun, the home offers a warm and inviting atmosphere throughout.\r\n\r\nSpacious, open-plan living captures sweeping views, complemented by a versatile annex ideal for a home office. Two well-proportioned bedrooms feature floor-to-ceiling windows, with the master bedroom opening onto a private balcony. Both bedrooms offer excellent built-in wardrobes. The well-appointed bathroom cleverly conceals the laundry and a separate cupboard provides practical storage for towels and bathroom essentials, while a separate toilet adds convenience.\r\n\r\nAccess is easy and flexible-take the lift for convenience or opt for the stairs if you're feeling active. Additional features include a dedicated carport and a secure storage locker, providing both practicality and extra space.\r\n\r\nA superb combination of style, comfort, and location, this apartment is ready to be enjoyed from day one.\r\n\r\nTo download property files please go to: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/JBZE",
